5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I will examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract to understand our current staffing capacity.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I'll look into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme. We can't just keep repeating the same mistakes.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will review the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells. I want to see who holds the final say and what hidden costs exist.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think I will look into the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates. I want to see the actual costs.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I'll be a detective! I want to see the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, and the journey audits on where minutes go. Let's find out where the time is hiding!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
